    "storeContent": [
        {
            "info": {
                "title": "McM3 (Meer Cheat Manager 3ds)",
                "author": "Meer",
                "version": "v0.2.3",
                "category": [
                    "utility"
                ],
                "console": [
                    "3DS"
                ],
                "description": "In-game cheat manager plugin for Luma3DS. Detects your game, has built-in cheats for 644 games and lets you set exact amounts. Open it in game with R + Down + Select.",
                "license": "gpl-3.0",
                "last_updated": "2026-11-23 at 16:55 (UTC)",
                "releasenotes": "## Fixes\n\n- **Fixed \"Fatal plugin error: abort() called\" when starting any game in v0.2.2.** v0.2.2 ran out of memory at startup. McM3 now uses its own lightweight loop again and loads about 240 KB, so it fits easily in 2 MiB.\n- **No more crashes when closing a game or going to the HOME Menu.** McM3 stops reading buttons as soon as the game starts closing, and pauses while you're on the HOME Menu or the lid is closed.\n- **R + Down + Select opens McM3 on the first press**, in any button order.\n- **Old 3DS:** McM3 stays at 2 MiB, so it doesn't take memory the system needs (#1).\n\n## Install\n\n1. Download **`McM3.3gx`** below.\n2. Put it at `sd:/luma/plugins/default.3gx` (replace the old one).\n3. Make sure **Plugin Loader** is on in Rosalina (L + Down + Select).\n4. Start a game, wait for \"McM3 detected\", then press **R + Down + Select**.\n\nUsing Universal-Updater with the McM3 UniStore? This shows up there as an update.\n\nFound a problem? [Open an issue](https://github.com/meerok/MeerCheatManager3ds/issues) with the game, your console (Old or New 3DS) and a photo of the error screen."
            },
            "McM3.3gx (all games)": [
                {
                    "type": "mkdir",
                    "directory": "sdmc:/luma/plugins/"
                },
                {
                    "type": "downloadRelease",
                    "repo": "meerok/MeerCheatManager3ds",
                    "file": "McM3.3gx",
                    "output": "sdmc:/luma/plugins/default.3gx",
                    "includePrereleases": false,
                    "message": "Downloading McM3..."
                },
                {
                    "type": "timeMsg",
                    "seconds": 6,
                    "message": "McM3 installed to /luma/plugins/default.3gx.\n\nTurn on Plugin Loader in Rosalina (L + Down + Select),\nstart a game, then press R + Down + Select."
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
